ps rotations."},{"name":"Skyward Blade","text":"High ER for reliable Burst uptime."},{"name":"Freedom-Sworn","text":"Team buffs if reactions trigger. Only when Energy is already covered."},{"name":"Sacrificial Sword","text":"Extra Skill after amulet collection. Collect old amulets before recasting. R3+ preferred."},{"name":"Festering Desire","text":"ER substat; modest Skill damage."},{"name":"Amenoma Kageuchi","text":"Self Energy after planned Skill casts. Requires multiple Skill uses before Burst. R3+ preferred."},{"name":"Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","text":"F2P ER and Skill CRIT Rate."},{"name":"Skyrider Sword","text":"Starter option with ER substat."}],"a":[{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Buffs team ATK after Burst.","stats":"ER · flexible · CRIT"},{"names":["The Exile"],"text":"Energy support on a budget.","stats":"ER · flexible · CRIT"},{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"ER plus some Burst damage.","stats":"ER · Electro · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Stormcaller Battery","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Beidou","Fischl","Xingqiu"],"text":"Traveler feeds Beidou Energy and shreds Electro RES at C2. Fischl generates particles; Xingqiu drives reactions with normal attacks.","roles":["Energy Support","Electro DPS","Electro Battery","Hydro Driver Support"]},{"name":"Xiao Energy Relay","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Xiao","Faruzan","Bennett"],"text":"Traveler supplies Xiao with flat Energy and ER from amulets. Faruzan boosts Anemo damage; Bennett heals and buffs.","roles":["Energy Support","Anemo DPS","Anemo Support","Healer/Buffer"]},{"name":"Eula Thunder Battery","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Eula","Rosaria","Mika"],"text":"Electro Traveler enables Superconduct and transfers Energy to Eula; Rosaria batteries Cryo and Mika provides sustain.","roles":["Energy Support","Physical DPS","Cryo Battery","Healer/Buffer"]},{"name":"Broken Toaster","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Yoimiya","Chevreuse","Bennett"],"text":"Burst follow-up strikes from Yoimiya normal hits can trigger Overloaded. Chevreuse buffs Pyro/Electro teams; time amulet pickup.","roles":["Energy Support","Pyro DPS","Overload Support","Healer/Buffer"]}],"v":"Universal Battery: ER-first Favonius build. Let your energy-hungry carry collect Skill amulets.\nNoblesse Buffer: Use 4pc Noblesse if no ally carries it; Burst before the main DPS window.\nExile Budget: 4pc The Exile gives team Energy on Burst; useful early-game option.\nBeidou Battery: Pair with Beidou and another Electro battery; transfer amulets to Beidou.\nBurst Sub DPS: Emblem and Electro/CRIT stats if team Energy is already secure.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Battery"],"about":"Electro Traveler is a universal Energy battery who gives allies flat Energy and Energy Recharge through Skill amulets and Burst follow-up strikes. Let the intended teammate collect amulets; the Traveler needs substantial ER to sustain their own costly Burst.","pros":["Energy for any element","Shares Energy Recharge","Accessible support options","Electro RES shred at C2"],"cons":["80-cost Burst","Low personal damage","Amulets need pickup","Limited Electro particles"],"weapons":["Favonius Sword","Skyward Blade","Freedom-Sworn","Sacrificial Sword","Festering Desire","Amenoma Kageuchi","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["The Exile"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge","Electro DMG / ER","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["ER: 200% - 300%","Fav CR: 50%+"],"vars":[{"title":"Noblesse Team Battery","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Skyward Blade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER sands; prioritize ER and Favonius CRIT Rate over personal damage.","teams":"Best when no other teammate uses Noblesse Oblige.","when":"Burst before the main damage window; switch to the carry to collect amulets and restore Energy.","cond":"","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Exile Budget Energy","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["The Exile"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize ER; 4-star artifact stats are naturally lower.","teams":"Teams needing cheap Energy support; suitable for early progression.","when":"Use Burst to grant extra team Energy, then Skill to place amulets for the selected teammate.","cond":"","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Beidou Energy Partner","role":"Battery","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"High ER for Traveler; CRIT Rate if holding Favonius.","teams":"Beidou plus a normal-attack driver; Fischl helps battery Traveler.","when":"Let Beidou collect Skill amulets. Burst follow-up strikes need the active character to hit with Normal or Charged Attacks.","cond":"","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Emblem Burst Damage","role":"Sub DPS","weapons":["Skyward Blade","Festering Desire"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER sands, Electro goblet, CRIT circlet; meet Burst ER before offensive stats.","teams":"Needs external particles or Electro resonance to sustain Traveler Burst.","when":"Use when Energy needs are covered and you want incidental Burst damage rather than maximum battery utility.","cond":"","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Skill Reset Utility","role":"Support","weapons":["Sacrificial Sword","Favonius Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER and on-field CRIT Rate for Favonius.","teams":"Teammates can pick up Skill amulets before a second Skill cast.","when":"Sacrificial reset enables another amulet cycle; new Skill erases any uncollected amulets.","cond":"Sacrificial passive proc and cooldown","notes":"A second Skill is not an automatic Energy gain unless amulets are actually collected.","pre":false}],"mats":["Brilliant Diamond Sliver","Brilliant Diamond Fragment","Brilliant Diamond Chunk","Brilliant Diamond Gemstone","","Teachings of Transience","Guide to Transience","Philosophies of Elegance","Old Handguard","Kageuchi Handguard","Kageuchi Handguard","Windwheel Aster","Dragon Lord's Crown","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 8-9"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Stormcaller Battery","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Beidou","Fischl","Xingqiu"]},{"name":"Xiao Energy Relay","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Xiao","Faruzan","Bennett"]},{"name":"Eula Thunder Battery","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Eula","Rosaria","Mika"]},{"name":"Broken Toaster","members":["Traveler (Electro)","Yoimiya","Chevreuse","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Traveler (Electro)","el":"Electro"}